\begin_layout Section
Genetic Programming 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "gp_Genetic-Programming"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Genetic programming (GP) is an evolutionary machine learning approach that
 automatically generates programs where, compared to neural networks, not
 only the correct parameterisation but also the correct formula must be
 found.
 The programs are implemented as a programming trees where nodes of operators
 and terminals represent its genes.
 The fitness is evaluated by testing its performance in the RL environment.
 Als Selektionsprozess ist die tournament selection sehr populär, bei der
 aus einer kleinen Menge an zufällig gewählten Kandidaten der Beste ausgewählt
 wird.
 Mutations can affect single nodes as well as complete branches.
 In the case of branch mutations, the complete branch is exchanged and replaced
 with a new, randomly generated branch with variable size.
\end_layout

